{
    "title": "Armored Robots: Mech Battle",
    "description": "Dive into the thrilling world of Armored Robots, the ultimate mobile battle game where you compete against other players in intense PvP robot battles. This arena-based shooter game lets you control and customize your own powerful mech, upgrading it with various parts and pieces to dominate the battlefield.\r\n\r\nIn Armored Robots, you'll engage in high-octane robot fighting games that test your skills and strategy. Choose from a vast array of robots and customize your mech with different weapons, armor, and special abilities. Whether you prefer long-range shooting or close-quarters combat, there's a setup for every playstyle.\r\n\r\nThe battle royale mode pits you against other players in a fight for survival, where only the strongest machine will emerge victorious. Navigate through intricate mech arena maps filled with obstacles, and strategic vantage points.\r\nBuild your ultimate war robot by earning rewards and upgrading your robot with new parts. The customization options are endless, allowing you to create a truly unique and powerful mecha.\r\n\r\nArmored Robots isn't just a shooter game; it's a dynamic and immersive experience that keeps you coming back for more. The stunning graphics, realistic physics, and explosive sound effects make every robot fight feel incredibly intense and satisfying.\r\nJoin the robot battle and prove your skills in the ultimate battle royale. Grab your weapons, gear up your robot, and step into the arena for the fight of your life.\r\nDominate the mech arena, conquer your foes, and become the champion of Armored Robots!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into the thrilling world of Armored Robots, the ultimate mobile battle game where you compete against other players in intense PvP robot battles. This arena-based shooter game lets you control and customize your own powerful mech, upgrading it with various parts and pieces to dominate the battlefield.<br><br>In Armored Robots, you&#39;ll engage in high-octane robot fighting games that test your skills and strategy. Choose from a vast array of robots and customize your mech with different weapons, armor, and special abilities. Whether you prefer long-range shooting or close-quarters combat, there&#39;s a setup for every playstyle.<br><br>The battle royale mode pits you against other players in a fight for survival, where only the strongest machine will emerge victorious. Navigate through intricate mech arena maps filled with obstacles, and strategic vantage points.<br>Build your ultimate war robot by earning rewards and upgrading your robot with new parts. The customization options are endless, allowing you to create a truly unique and powerful mecha.<br><br>Armored Robots isn&#39;t just a shooter game; it&#39;s a dynamic and immersive experience that keeps you coming back for more. The stunning graphics, realistic physics, and explosive sound effects make every robot fight feel incredibly intense and satisfying.<br>Join the robot battle and prove your skills in the ultimate battle royale. Grab your weapons, gear up your robot, and step into the arena for the fight of your life.<br>Dominate the mech arena, conquer your foes, and become the champion of Armored Robots!",
    "summary": "Upgrade your robot for the royal battle and join the war in the arena!",
